```env
# WorldQuant Brain credentials (single-account mode)
WQ_USERNAME=your_email@example.com
WQ_PASSWORD=your_password

# LLM Provider selection: deepseek | ollama | gemini (Choose one)
LLM_PROVIDER=deepseek

# Option 1: DeepSeek API (recommended - faster, no local GPU required)
# DeepSeek API Settings
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=your_deepseek_api_key_here
DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-coder
DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com

# Option 2: Ollama (local models)
# Ollama Settings (used when LLM_PROVIDER=ollama)
OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen2.5-coder:7b

# Option
# Gemini Settings (used when LLM_PROVIDER=gemini)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash
GEMINI_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai/

# Notification Configuration (optional; no notifications if not configured)
# Feishu: Group Settings → Bots → Add Bot → Custom Bot → Copy Webhook URL
# FEISHU_WEBHOOK=https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/bot/v2/hook/xxx

# Feishu Bot Command Control (used by feishu_bot.py) 
# Feishu Open Platform → App Management → Create App → Get App ID and App Secret
# FEISHU_APP_ID=cli_xxx
# FEISHU_APP_SECRET=xxx
# FEISHU_BOT_PORT=9000

# Team Multi-Account Configuration (used by run_team_miner.py) 
# Uncomment and fill in the credentials to enable 1–10 accounts
# WQ_USERNAME_1=user1@gmail.com
# WQ_PASSWORD_1=password1
# WQ_MEMBER_ID_1=alice

# WQ_USERNAME_2=user2@gmail.com
# WQ_PASSWORD_2=password2
# WQ_MEMBER_ID_2=bob

# WQ_USERNAME_3=user3@gmail.com
# WQ_PASSWORD_3=password3
# WQ_MEMBER_ID_3=charlie

# WQ_USERNAME_4=user4@gmail.com
# WQ_PASSWORD_4=password4
# WQ_MEMBER_ID_4=david
```
